      <activity id="4e8ef36f-aa21-5552-8ecc-7392c228530d" activityNameId="e68f472c-0a07-5690-88d6-36aeff4aadd0" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, locomotive</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, locomotive
The data is based on the bulk material composition of the RE 460, a locomotive which is currently used for goods transportation in Switzerland and also in Germany. The life span of the locomotive Re 460 is assumed to be 40 years resulting in a life time performance of 9.6 Mio. kilometres. ;
UUID: 901f899e-3660-464e-8213-ba238dd431b3
The inventory includes waste treatment processes for non metal components of a locomotive. For the transport of disposed materials standard distances have been applied.
Location: Data represents Swiss and German conditions
Technology: no technologies are specified
Time period: Data represents a locomotive currently in operation
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data based on expert estimate on the material consumption of a locomotive. 
Extrapolations: Data  for Switzerland is used as an estimate for Europe
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_901f899e-3660-464e-8213-ba238dd431b3.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
